#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
IPSB/RDQM Health Check Framework - Step 2A (SDR Channel Discovery)

Adds:
- For each *active* QM on this node (per rdqmstatus "This node"), run:
    echo "DIS CHSTATUS(*) WHERE(CHLTYPE EQ SDR)" | runmqsc <QM>
  Parse channel status lines and store under:
    discovery.channels_sdr[QMNAME][CHANNEL] = { "status": "...", "chltype": "SDR" }

Still intentionally light on alerting:
- Only emits findings for command execution failures (rdqmstatus/dspmq/runmqsc).
- No "required channel" rules yet (that is Step 2B).
"""

